    attacker-controlled components of the subject can <em>also</em> contain the delimiter), which is why
    in practice Trusted Publishing and Sigstore both emphasize IdP-specific claims that represent
    each <em>part</em> of the subject’s identity rather than a bespoke composite form. <a href="#fnref:sub" class="reversefootnote" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></p>
    </li>
    <li id="fn:effective">
